==Battleground==
*1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Maawth]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
*2 [[Maawth]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
*4 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
*4 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Try to kill the Mooths ASAP for money. Stalling and then killing them one by one, so you can use all their money, will make this battle much easier. Alternatively, you can spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] (in base or evolved, but not true form), and his enormous attack power will wreck all the Mooths. [[J.K. Bun Bun]] might get knocked back from the blast, and the spawning of [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun]] and [[Li'l Nyandam (Special Cat)|Catdam]] with [[Crazed Gross Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Gross]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Legs]] will result in a quick win.

It is also possible to cheese the stage. Use the [[Crazy Hearts (Combo)|Crazy Hearts]] [[Cat Combo]] along with Awakened Bahamut, and send him out as soon as all four Mooths are at the [[Cat Base]]. If done correctly, the Mooths will all die at once and you can destroy the base before J.K. Bun Bun comes out. This works on all Crown difficulties.

